    // --- the Proving Circle's champions ------------------------------------
    //
    // Warriors the Vael took from other worlds, and what the player is up
    // against in the Circle: not enemies but rivals, each an avatar with the
    // player's own kit — the same controller, the same jump, the same combo
    // engine — and a brain at its controls instead of a keyboard. A rival is
    // a flat group like anyone's, an `avatar` group like the player's, and a
    // `brain` (see `BrainStats` in src/assets.rs); there is no `ai`, because
    // nothing about it walks a route.
    //
    // What makes each one itself is what it swings (`attack`, a style from
    // attacks.ron), what it throws, how fast it reacts, and whether it takes
    // to the air.

    // Kesh of the Glass Dunes: quick feet and a quicker blade. Faster than
    // the player on the ground, a combo that comes out in two thirds of the
    // time, and fragile for it — two clean combos put her down.
    "kesh": StatBlock(
        width: 20.0,
